[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5087086489","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121646#issuecomment-5087086489","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121646","id":5087086489,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLzbHmQ","user":{"login":"Synzorasize","id":60207816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjA3ODE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60207816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize","html_url":"https://github.com/Synzorasize","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-27T03:54:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T03:54:06Z","body":"I think this should also apply to `Polygon2D`, `CollisionPolygon2D` and any other node where you can add vertices. Since I'm only procedurally generating vertices through code using a tool script, it's very annoying that clicking anywhere seems to add new vertices automatically (and also remove the previous polygon data... :/ ) unless you click on `Edit Vertex`. Of course, this is my personal opinion, can't say how others use it, since having it on `Add Vertex` upon creating the node can save time. I think it should at least save your preference for `Edit Vertex` when you click on it again in the `SceneTreeEditor` instead of switching back to `Add Vertex` automatically every time.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5087086489/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]